  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "To catch up to Fang Yuan, Feng Jin Huang uses double action, then small wishful hand. Two small and compact hands fly out of her mind, completely formed from will, emitting a jade luster. Her own two hands regulate the intensity and temperature of two fire lumps, while the two small wishful hands grab materials and throw them into the fire.",
      "chapters": [
        853
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_feng_jin_huang"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan sees through Feng Jin Huang’s trap, but between her two killer moves, small wishful hand is real. Double action had only been a facade. With the two small hands made of will, her refinement speed is slightly above Fang Yuan’s. Sun Yao calls the small wishful hand killer move convenient. Qin Juan notes that maintaining a killer move requires primeval essence and taxes the mind.",
      "chapters": [
        854
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "martial-duel",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_sun_yao",
        "char_qin_juan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Feng Jin Huang uses four killer moves together. Six lumps of fire float in front of her, each accompanied by a small wishful hand that grabs materials and throws them into the fire. With that help, the amount of Gu refinement materials thrown into the flames is extremely precise.",
      "chapters": [
        855
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
